<title>USA: Northwestern Public Service names chairman.</title>
<headline>Northwestern Public Service names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HURON, S.D. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwestern Public Service said Thursday that President and Chief Executive Merle Lewis has been elected chairman.</p>
<p>Lewis succeeds Robert Wilkens, who is retiring.</p>
<p>The change is effective May 1.</p>
